OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOften cloudy
OL,6,Fthis evening and overnight with some
OL,7,Fclear spells for a time. However
OL,8,Fdrizzly interludes likely,
OL,9,Fparticularly over the hills.
OL,10,FStrengthening winds later in the night
OL,11,Fahead of the next band of rain.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA spell of wet and windy
OL,14,Fweather soon sweeping east during the
OL,15,Fmorning. Drier and sunny spells
OL,16,Ffollowing. Feeling cooler than Monday
OL,17,Fwith a fresh, gusty breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
